@startuml F1.20-D01-listar-atendimentos
title F1.20-D01 — Listar atendimentos
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
autonumber

actor "Aluno" as Aluno
participant "WebApp" as WebApp
participant "JwtFilter" as Jwt
participant "ServiceRecordController" as Ctrl
database "Postgres" as Postgres

Aluno -> WebApp: abre /meus-atendimentos
WebApp -> Jwt: GET /atendimentos?aluno=me
Jwt -> Ctrl: JWT ok
Ctrl -> Postgres: SELECT atendimentos
Postgres --> Ctrl: lista
Ctrl --> WebApp: 200 + _links.acknowledge?
WebApp --> Aluno: tabela\n(Estou ciente se link)

@enduml
